  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You exhibit the qualities of your drachiri benefactor, as per the Drachiri Benefactor table. </span>When you gain this feat, you gain a new trait from your Benefactor you do not have.<span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"> You can substitute the damage types and traits of attacks and spells with the drachiri trait or similar draconic sources with that of your attuned trait. If your attuned trait is Vitality or Void, you deal their respective damage types, but not their healing.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You can take this feat multiple times; each time you do, you add a new trait from your chosen Benefactor’s Elements &amp; Energies column that you do not have.</span></p>"
